WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.461
Week 9: Daily Routine and Reflexive Verbs. sequence a routine say what is happening now compare schedules

2
00:00:07.461 --> 00:00:13.791
Mission brief. Narrate a full day and then report an unexpected change happening now.

3
00:00:13.791 --> 00:00:23.195
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:23.195 --> 00:00:30.976
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:30.976 --> 00:00:39.503
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:39.503 --> 00:01:06.956
Model language. Voy a narrar un día completo. — I am going to narrate a full day. Informo un cambio inesperado. — I report an unexpected change. El cambio ocurre mientras estudio. — The change occurs while I am studying. Mientras tanto, reacciono con calma. — Meanwhile, I react calmly. Explico cómo resolví la situación. — I explain how I resolved the situation.

7
00:01:06.956 --> 00:01:16.854
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
